; TITHE - THE DECK BUILDER's theme: THE TOLLKEEPER
;
; Written as the Bulwark's second option; the owner set it aside for the
; deck designer page (TITHE-PLAN 13.0's builder theme), where a guild's
; counting-house tune suits a player sorting their cards.
;
; The Bulwark's other face - the gold. A guild band's tune in D with C
; natural in it (mixolydian: earthy rather than bright), SWUNG: the groove
; is three ticks then two, so every pair of 16ths lilts 60:40 and the beat is
; 109 BPM. The trumpet counts coins in running eighths, the lute chops the
; off-beats, the bass plucks roots and fifths. A turns round D and C; B goes
; up through G and lands on D.

song bultoll "Deck builder: The Tollkeeper"
groove 3 2
unit 16
rows 32
measure 16
voice lead trumpet
voice bass pluckbass
voice chord lute

; --- the band tunes in: the bass line, on the lead so the speaker has it ------
lead LI = o4 d8 r8 a8 r8 >d8< r8 a8 r8 | d8 r8 a8 r8 d8 e8 f+8 g8 |
bass BI = o2 l4 d a d a | d a d a |
chord CI = o3 r1 | r1 |
drum DI = k8 h8 r8 h8 k8 h8 r8 h8 | k8 h8 s8 h8 k8 h8 s8 s8 |

; --- A ------------------------------------------------------------------------
lead LA1 = o4 a8 f+16 g16 a8 d8 f+8 e8 d4 | e8 c16 d16 e8 g8 e8 d8 c4 |
lead LA2 = o4 a8 f+16 g16 a8 >d8< a8 f+8 d8 f+8 | e8 d8 c+8 e8 a4 r4 |
lead LA3 = o4 b8 g16 a16 b8 >d8< b8 a8 g4 | a8 f+16 g16 a8 >d8< a8 f+8 d4 |
lead LA4 = o4 e8 g8 >c8< g8 a8 e8 c+8 e8 | d4 f+8 a8 d4 r4 |
; --- B ------------------------------------------------------------------------
lead LB1 = o5 d8. c16 d8 e8 d8< b8 g4 | >c8. <b16 a8 b8 a8 f+8 d4 |
lead LB2 = o4 e8 g8 >c8 d8 e8 d8 c8< g8 | a8 f+8 d8 f+8 a4 r4 |
lead LB3 = o5 d8. c16 d8 e8 d8< b8 g4 | a8. b16 a8 f+8 a8 >d8 f+4< |
lead LB4 = o5 e8 d8 c8< g8 a8 c+8 e8 g8 | f+8 e8 d8 c+8 d4 r4 |

bass BDC = o2 l4 d a d a | c g c g |
bass BDA = o2 l4 d a d a | a e a e |
bass BGD = o2 l4 g d g d | d a d a |
bass BCD = o2 l4 c g a e | d a d4 r4 |
bass BCD2 = o2 l4 c g c g | d a d a |
chord CDC = o3 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 |
            r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 |
chord CDA = o3 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 |
            r8 [c+ e a]8 r8 [c+ e a]8 r8 [c+ e a]8 r8 [c+ e a]8 |
chord CGD = o3 r8 [d g b]8 r8 [d g b]8 r8 [d g b]8 r8 [d g b]8 |
            r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 |
chord CCD = o3 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c+ e a]8 r8 [c+ e a]8 |
            r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r4 |
chord CCA = o3 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 r8 [c e g]8 |
            r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 r8 [d f+ a]8 |

drum DT = k8 h8 s8 h8 k8 h8 s8 h8 | k8 h8 s8 h8 k8 k8 s8 h8 |
drum DF = k8 h8 s8 h8 k8 h8 s8 h8 | k8 h8 s8 h8 s16 s16 s16 s16 T8 t8 |

order LI BI CI DI
order LA1 BDC CDC DT          ; 1: the loop comes back here
order LA2 BDA CDA DT
order LA3 BGD CGD DT
order LA4 BCD CCD DF
order LB1 BGD CGD DT
order LB2 BCD2 CCA DT
order LB3 BGD CGD DT
order LB4 BCD CCD DF
loop 1
